    "number": "46",
    "title": "No unnecessary restraint",
    "content": "The person arrested shall not be subjected to more restraint than is necessary to prevent his escape.\n",
    "html": "<article class=\"provision\" data-n=\"46\" data-report=\"Section 46 · The Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"prov-head\"><h3 class=\"prov-title\"><span class=\"n\">46</span>No unnecessary restraint</h3></div><p class=\"prov-cite\">Section 46 · Chapter V</p><div class=\"prov-body\"><p>The person arrested shall not be subjected to more restraint than is necessary to prevent his escape.</p></div></article>",
